    "body": "> It looks bikeshed updated a lot of places in dom.html. Is it okay?\n\nIt looks to me like it's mostly updates to the syntax highlighting, but I commented on one troublesome reference removal. But it doesn't seem worth preventing merge. As long as you used the latest Bikeshed (either via the HTTP API or by pulling the latest from master and running `bikeshed update`) then these changes should not be a problem.\n",
